    "long_instructions": "## Wireframing and Flowchart Chatbot\r\n\r\nUse this chatbot to plan your flowchart and wireframe before drawing.\r\nIt can help you outline steps, identify decision points, and think through how your interface connects to your app’s logic.\r\n\r\n:::details [<i class=\"fa fa-briefcase\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> **Possible Stems**]\r\n* “Can you help me describe how my app’s logic should flow?”\r\n* “Here’s what I want my app to do — what should go in my flowchart?”\r\n* “What sections should I include in my wireframe for this type of app?”\r\n* “How can I show different outcomes clearly in my flowchart?”\r\n:::",
